-- that matched a Wikipedia list (1958-2025).
-- chart_entries.chart_date is the Wikipedia issue date of the first week at No. 1.
-- chart_entries.weeks_at_position is the total weeks at No. 1, including a run
-- that continues into the next calendar year.
-- songs.release_year is the calendar year of that first issue date, because
-- the number_one_hits view exposes release_year as year.
